## What this implementation already does

- Simulates a real-time stream with `setInterval`
- Displays changing metrics
- Draws a live-updating line chart
- Lets users:
  - enter operator name
  - change alert threshold
  - change refresh rate
  - enable/disable alerts
- Validates form input
- Shows event log entries for alerts and setting changes
- Supports pausing/resuming updates

