## Limitations of this initial version
This is a good starting point, but not yet production-grade. Notable gaps:
- single process only
- in-memory state only
- no persistence or replay
- no symbol-based subscription filtering
- coarse locking with a global mutex
- no backpressure handling for slow subscribers
- no authentication/authorization
- no binary protocol
- no metrics/tracing
- no out-of-order tick handling policy
- rolling window recalculation is O(n) per tick

## Recommended next improvements
1. shard state by symbol to reduce lock contention  
2. maintain incremental aggregates instead of recalculating every time  
3. support per-symbol subscriptions  
