# 6) Important limitations of this initial version

This is a **starter implementation**, not yet a production ultra-low-latency router. Current limitations:

- forwarding is done with `AF_PACKET` raw sockets, not zero-copy
- no batching
- no multi-queue / RSS awareness
- no CPU affinity or NUMA tuning
- no MAC rewrite / neighbor discovery logic
- single filtering rule only
- no stats map / telemetry
- no AF_XDP rings
- no checksum fixups if packet headers are modified
- no IPv6 support
- no TCP state tracking
- no lock-free rule update pipeline

