  - `set memory_limit_mb <n>`
  - `set cpu_limit_pct <n>`
- runs as a long-lived async daemon
- is structured so you can later add:
  - cgroups integration
  - process throttling
  - service management
  - metrics export
  - logging/journald
  - privilege separation

