## Limitations of this minimal version
- IPv4 only
- Ethernet only
- TCP/UDP only
- no flow expiration
- no TCP flag analysis
- no fragmentation handling
- fixed-size table with bounded probing
- single-threaded
- not NUMA-aware
- no zero-copy kernel-bypass capture

