# 4. Example engine-side usage

A typical engine integration loop might look like this:

```cpp
CP_Initialize();

CPWorldHandle world = CP_CreateWorld({0.0f, -9.81f, 0.0f});

CPBodyDesc bodyDesc{};
bodyDesc.type = CP_BODY_DYNAMIC;
bodyDesc.mass = 10.0f;
bodyDesc.transform.position = {0.0f, 10.0f, 0.0f};
bodyDesc.transform.rotationEuler = {0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f};
bodyDesc.initialVelocity = {0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f};

CPBodyHandle body = CP_CreateBody(world, &bodyDesc);

// Per frame:
CP_ApplyForce(body, {5.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f});
CP_StepWorld(world, 1.0f / 60.0f);

CPTransform transform = CP_GetTransform(body);
// Push transform back into engine actor/entity

CP_DestroyBody(world, body);
CP_DestroyWorld(world);
CP_Shutdown();
```

