- authentication and authorization
- mTLS / OAuth2 / service identity
- PCI-safe handling of sensitive data
- persistent database storage
- proper idempotency conflict semantics
- double-entry ledger integration
- transactional outbox / message bus publishing
- reconciliation workflows
- sanctions screening / AML / fraud checks
- limits, holds, reversals, chargebacks, returns
- audit immutability
- encryption at rest / secrets management
- distributed tracing and SIEM integration
- HA/DR, multi-region, and settlement lifecycle support

